#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.ex:551
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run Buildkite jobs on Tuist runners. Tuist watches the self-hosted queues in your cluster and runs what it finds there."
msgstr "在 Tuist 執行器上執行 Buildkite 作業。Tuist 會監控你集群中的自託管佇列，並執行找到的作業。"

