msgstr "請檢查 GitLab URL 和 Runner 驗證權杖。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.html.heex:289
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Create a GitLab runner with your Tuist profile tags, disable untagged jobs, and paste its token here. Select the machine in your pipeline with tags such as [tuist-macos]."
msgstr "使用你的 Tuist 設定檔標籤建立 GitLab runner，停用未加標籤的作業，並將其權杖貼到此處。在流水線中選擇帶有 [tuist-macos] 等標籤的機器。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.html.heex:268
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run GitLab CI jobs on Tuist runners. Choose a machine for each job using pipeline tags."
msgstr "在 Tuist 執行器上運行 GitLab CI 工作。使用管線標籤為每個工作選擇機器。"

